{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>המושל</b> (the ruler) — two times in the Masorah: here and the other: 'if the spirit of המושל rises upon you' (Ecclesiastes 10:4). Abraham said to him: even if the spirit of המושל or any coercion rises upon you, do not abandon your place, but go to my land." "<b>נא ידך</b> — in gematria: מילה (circumcision) — for he swore him by circumcision."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {0 "The juxtaposition reading: the second occurrence in Ecclesiastes 10:4 supplies the phrase 'רוח המושל' that Ba'al HaTurim reads back into the Genesis narrative.", 1 "The gematria of נא ידך equals that of מילה (both = 95), which Ba'al HaTurim states without writing the numeric value."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:45.195326527Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}